               <span class='ba-hero-gradient'>اللغة والتقنية</span><br/>
               بوابتك إلى التعلّم الذاتي.
             </h1>
             <p class='ba-hero-subtitle hero-reveal'>
               محتوى تحليلي عميق يجمع بين إتقان اللغة الإنجليزية، والتقنية الحديثة، والثقافة الرقمية.
               لأنّ التعلّم المنهجي هو المفتاح الحقيقي للفرص في عالم متسارع التغيّر.
             </p>
             <div class='ba-hero-actions hero-reveal'>
               <a class='btn btn--primary' href='/p/blog-page_52.html'>
                 <i class='fas fa-graduation-cap'/> ابدأ التعلّم
               </a>
               <a class='btn btn--ghost' href='/p/blog-page_25.html'>
                 <i class='fas fa-compass'/> استكشف المحتوى
               </a>
             </div>
             <ul class='ba-hero-socials hero-reveal' aria-label='روابط التواصل الاجتماعي'>
               <li><a class='ba-social' href='#' aria-label='X'><i class='fab fa-x-twitter'/></a></li>
               <li><a class='ba-social' href='#' aria-label='LinkedIn'><i class='fab fa-linkedin-in'/></a></li>
               <li><a class='ba-social' href='#' aria-label='YouTube'><i class='fab fa-youtube'/></a></li>
               <li><a class='ba-social' href='#' aria-label='GitHub'><i class='fab fa-github'/></a></li>
             </ul>
           </div>
         </div>
       </section>

      <!-- &#9552;&#9552; شريط ميزات المنصة &#9552;&#9552; -->
      <div class='ba-features-strip fade-in-section'>

        <a class='ba-feature-item arabic-text' data-cat='original' href='/p/blog-page_29.html' title='تصفّح المحتوى الأصيل'>
          <div class='ba-feature-icon'><i class='fas fa-pen-fancy'/></div>
          <div>
            <div class='ba-feature-title'>محتوى أصيل</div>
            <div class='ba-feature-desc'>مقالات تحليلية معم&#1617;قة بأسلوب واضح</div>
          </div>
          <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-angle-left ba-feature-arrow'/>
        </a>

        <div class='ba-feature-sep'/>

        <a class='ba-feature-item arabic-text' data-cat='learn' href='/p/blog-page_52.html' title='ابدأ رحلة التعلّم'>
          <div class='ba-feature-icon ba-feature-icon--learn'>
            <i class='fas fa-graduation-cap'/>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class='ba-feature-title'>تعل&#1617;م مدروس</div>
            <div class='ba-feature-desc'>منهج لغوي مرن يناسب إيقاعك</div>
          </div>
          <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-angle-left ba-feature-arrow'/>
        </a>

        <div class='ba-feature-sep'/>

        <a class='ba-feature-item arabic-text' data-cat='podcast' href='/p/blog-page_54.html' title='استمع إلى النقاشات الفكرية'>
          <div class='ba-feature-icon ba-feature-icon--podcast'>
            <i class='fas fa-microphone-alt'/>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class='ba-feature-title'>نقاشات فكرية</div>
            <div class='ba-feature-desc'>بودكاست يأخذك في رحلة التأمل</div>
          </div>
          <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-angle-left ba-feature-arrow'/>
        </a>

        <div class='ba-feature-sep'/>

        <a class='ba-feature-item arabic-text' data-cat='quotes' href='/p/blog-page_73.html' title='اكتشف مقولات اليوم'>
          <div class='ba-feature-icon ba-feature-icon--quotes'>
            <i class='fas fa-lightbulb'/>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class='ba-feature-title'>إلهام يومي</div>
            <div class='ba-feature-desc'>اقتباسات ت&#1615;حف&#1617;ز العقل وت&#1615;لهم التفكير</div>
          </div>
          <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-angle-left ba-feature-arrow'/>
        </a>

      </div>

      <!-- &#9552;&#9552; أحدث المحتوى &#9552;&#9552; -->
      <section class='ba-best-section fade-in-section'>
        <div class='ba-section-head'>
          <span class='ba-section-badge arabic-text'><i class='fas fa-layer-group'/> المحتوى</span>
          <h2 class='ba-section-title arabic-text'>أحدث المقالات</h2>
        </div>
        <div aria-label='تصفية المقالات' class='posts-filter-bar' id='posts-filter-bar' role='group'>
          <button class='posts-filter-btn active' data-filter='all' type='button'>الكل</button>
        </div>
        <!-- &#9552;&#9552; Skeleton Loaders: يظهر أثناء تحميل الصفحة ويختفي تلقائيا&#1611; &#9552;&#9552; -->
        <div aria-hidden='true' class='posts-skeleton-wrap' id='posts-skeleton'>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 1 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 2 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 3 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 4 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 5 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Skeleton Card 6 -->
          <div class='skeleton-card'>
            <div class='skeleton-thumb'/>
            <div class='skeleton-card-content'>
              <div class='skeleton-label'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title'/>
              <div class='skeleton-title-short'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-snippet'/>
              <div class='skeleton-footer'>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-left'/>
                <div class='skeleton-footer-right'/>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- ══ Real Posts Grid (server-rendered) ══ -->
        <b:if cond='data:posts'>
        <section aria-label='أحدث المقالات' class='posts-grid ba-best-grid' id='posts-grid' style='display:grid'>
          <b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'>
            <article class='post-card fin-clickable-card' expr:data-url='data:post.url'>
              <div class='card-image-wrapper'>
                <b:if cond='data:post.firstImageUrl'>
                  <a expr:href='data:post.url'>
                    <img width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image lazy' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:data-src='data:post.firstImageUrl' expr:src='data:post.firstImageUrl' loading='lazy' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/>
                  </a>
                <b:elseif cond='data:post.thumbnailUrl'/>
                  <a expr:href='data:post.url'>
                    <img width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image lazy' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:data-src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' expr:src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' loading='lazy' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/>
                  </a>
                <b:else/>
                  <a expr:href='data:post.url'>
                    <img alt='' width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image' loading='lazy' src='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png'/>
                  </a>
                </b:if>
              </div>
              <div class='card-content'>
                <b:if cond='data:post.labels'>
                  <div class='card-labels'>
                    <b:loop values='data:post.labels' var='label'>
                      <a class='card-label' expr:href='data:label.url'><data:label.name/></a>
                    </b:loop>
                  </div>
                </b:if>
                <h2 class='card-title'><a expr:href='data:post.url'><data:post.title/></a></h2>
                <p class='card-snippet'><data:post.snippet/></p>
                <div class='card-footer'>
                  <div class='card-date'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-calendar'/> <data:post.date/></div>
                  <a class='read-link arabic-text' expr:href='data:post.url'>اقرأ المزيد <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-arrow-left'/></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </b:loop>
        </section>
        <b:else/>
        <div class='no-results-state' role='status' style='text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;grid-column:1/-1'>
          <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-magnifying-glass' style='font-size:2.2rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem;display:block'/>
          <b:if cond='data:blog.searchQuery'>
            <h3 class='arabic-text' style='font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:.4rem'>لا توجد نتائج لـ "<data:blog.searchQuery/>"</h3>
            <p class='arabic-text' style='color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem'>جرّب كلمات مفتاحية أخرى أو تصفّح أحدث المقالات أدناه.</p>
          <b:else/>
            <h3 class='arabic-text' style='font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:.4rem'>لا توجد مقالات لعرضها حالياً</h3>
          </b:if>
        </div>
        </b:if>

      </section>

      <!-- fin-quotes: صفحتها المستقلة /p/blog-page_73.html &#8212; موجودة في بوابة المحتوى أعلاه -->

      <!-- fin-podcast + fin-learn: لكل منهما صفحة مستقلة (/p/blog-page_54 و /p/blog-page_52)
           يظهران في صفحاتهما المستقلة &#8212; ba-nav-grid است&#1615;بدل بـ ba-features-strip -->


      <!-- fin-works: ن&#1615;قل لصفحته المستقلة /p/blog-page_96.html -->
      <!-- Contact form: ن&#1615;قل لصفحته المستقلة &#8212; static_page تواصل معي -->

      <!-- &#9552;&#9552; قسم "تعلّم" الجديد &#8212; مستلهَم من مفهوم تنظيم المحتوى التعليمي &#9552;&#9552; -->
      <section class='ba-learn-strip fade-in-section arabic-text'>
        <div class='ba-section-head' style='justify-content:center;text-align:center;flex-direction:column'>
          <h2 class='ba-section-title'>تعلّم</h2>
          <p class='ba-learn-strip-desc'>دروس وموارد تساعدك على اكتساب مهارات جديدة وتطوير نفسك.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='ba-learn-strip-grid'>
          <div class='ba-learn-strip-item'>
            <div class='ba-learn-strip-icon'><i class='fas fa-signs-post'/></div>
            <h3>مسارات تعلّم</h3>
            <p>مسارات منظمة لتعلّم مهارات خطوة بخطوة.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='ba-learn-strip-item'>
            <div class='ba-learn-strip-icon'><i class='fas fa-gift'/></div>
            <h3>موارد مجانية</h3>
            <p>كتب، دورات، ومصادر مفيدة.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='ba-learn-strip-item'>
            <div class='ba-learn-strip-icon'><i class='fas fa-bullseye'/></div>
            <h3>نصائح عملية</h3>
            <p>استراتيجيات ونصائح عملية للتعلّم المستمر.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='ba-learn-strip-item'>
            <div class='ba-learn-strip-icon'><i class='fas fa-code'/></div>
            <h3>مشاريع تطبيقية</h3>
            <p>أمثلة ومشاريع تطبيقية لما تعلّمه في الواقع.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style='text-align:center;margin-top:2rem'>
          <a class='ba-btn ba-btn-primary' href='/p/blog-page_52.html'>ابدأ رحلة التعلّم <i class='fas fa-graduation-cap'/></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- &#9552;&#9552; Newsletter + Author Strip (مدمَج) &#9552;&#9552; -->
      <section class='ba-final-strip fade-in-section arabic-text'>
        <div class='ba-newsletter-card ba-final-nl'>
          <div class='ba-nl-icon'><i class='fas fa-envelope-open-text'/></div>
          <div class='ba-nl-form-wrap'>
            <label class='ba-nl-label' for='ba-nl-email'>اشترك في النشرة البريدية</label>
            <form class='ba-nl-form' id='ba-nl-form' novalidate='novalidate'>
              <div class='ba-nl-row'>
                <input aria-label='البريد الإلكتروني' autocomplete='email' class='ba-nl-input' id='ba-nl-email' inputmode='email' placeholder='example@email.com' required='required' type='email'/>
                <button class='ba-nl-submit' id='ba-nl-btn' type='submit'>
                  <i class='fas fa-paper-plane'/> اشترك
                </button>
              </div>
              <p aria-live='polite' class='ba-nl-status' id='ba-nl-status'/>
              <p class='ba-nl-disclaimer'>لن نرسل رسائل مزعجة &#8212; إلغاء الاشتراك متى شئت.</p>
            </form>
            <noscript><p style='margin-top:.6rem;padding:.6rem .9rem;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><i class='fas fa-info-circle' style='margin-left:.4rem;color:#94a3b8'/>نموذج الاشتراك يتطلب تفعيل JavaScript في المتصفح.</p></noscript>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='ba-final-author'>
          <img alt='أشرف أياو' class='ba-final-author-img' loading='lazy' decoding='async' src='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhMOEOx0nzwUe8NZ0mEUq9dZtSojz2rd7vAN-fVk-oI2Vb1jtE9tUmlrhr90Z0nOtJdcyhqAw4R8cc9r0qd9kpjMSPK5hY8ikPUqzJJyERQ8wffRDKtNIbA_1awJpA-lqY6BRsbNMUBYgxx-KfEkLdsaLUjyPQVu2uWzvO2ZGV0DbDE6Az99FXcpMfzjpne/s300/Achraf_20250127_161022_0000.jpg'/>
          <div class='ba-final-author-text'>
            <h3>أشرف أياو</h3>
            <p>كاتب محتوى &#183; مقد&#1616;&#1617;م بودكاست &#183; مراجع تقني</p>
            <div class='ba-final-author-socials'>
              <a aria-label='يوتيوب' href='https://youtube.com/@electrelavi' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-youtube'/></a>
              <a aria-label='تويتر' href='https://x.com/achraf_ayaou' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-twitter'/></a>
              <a aria-label='لينكدإن' href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/achraf-ayaou-40a970196' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-linkedin-in'/></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

  <!-- &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; STATIC PAGE &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; -->
  <b:elseif cond='data:blog.pageType == &quot;static_page&quot;'/>
    <b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'>

      <!-- صفحة التواصل المستقلة: يجب أن يكون عنوان الصفحة في Blogger = "تواصل معي" -->
      <b:if cond='data:blog.url contains &quot;blog-page_05&quot;'>
        <div class='contact-standalone container'>
          <div class='contact-page-hero arabic-text'>
            <span class='contact-eyebrow'><i class='fas fa-envelope-open-text'/> تواصل مباشر</span>
            <h1 class='contact-page-h1'>أرسل رسالتك</h1>
            <p class='contact-page-sub'>هل لديك استفسار أو تريد التعاون&#1567; يسعدني الرد في أقرب وقت.</p>
            <div class='contact-page-socials'>
              <a aria-label='تويتر' class='cps-link' href='https://x.com/achraf_ayaou' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='--sc:var(--social-twitter)' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-twitter'/></a>
              <a aria-label='يوتيوب' class='cps-link' href='https://youtube.com/@electrelavi' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='--sc:#FF0000' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-youtube'/></a>
              <a aria-label='انستغرام' class='cps-link' href='https://www.instagram.com/achraf_ayaou/' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='--sc:#E1306C' target='_blank'><i class='fab fa-instagram'/></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class='contact-form-card contact-page-card'>
            <form class='contact-form' id='contact-form' novalidate='novalidate'>
              <div class='field-group'>
                <label class='field-label arabic-text' for='contact-name'>الاسم الكامل</label>
                <input autocomplete='name' class='field-input arabic-text' id='contact-name' name='name' placeholder='اكتب اسمك' required='required' type='text'/>
              </div>
              <div class='field-group'>
                <label class='field-label arabic-text' for='contact-email'>البريد الإلكتروني</label>
                <input autocomplete='email' class='field-input arabic-text' id='contact-email' name='email' placeholder='name@example.com' required='required' type='email'/>
              </div>
              <div class='field-group'>
                <label class='field-label arabic-text' for='contact-message'>الرسالة</label>
                <textarea class='field-textarea arabic-text' id='contact-message' name='message' placeholder='اكتب رسالتك هنا...' required='required'/>
              </div>
              <div class='contact-submit-row'>
                <p aria-live='polite' class='contact-feedback arabic-text' id='contact-status'/>
                <button class='btn btn-primary contact-submit arabic-text' id='contact-btn' type='submit'><i class='fas fa-paper-plane'/> إرسال</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>

      <!-- باقي الصفحات الثابتة: العرض الاعتيادي -->
      <b:else/>
        <div class='fin-static-page'>
          <div class='container'>
            <article class='fin-static-article'>
              <h1 class='fin-static-title arabic-text'><data:post.title/></h1>
              <div class='fin-static-body arabic-text'><data:post.body/></div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </b:if>

    </b:loop>

  <!-- &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; LABEL PAGE &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; -->
  <b:elseif cond='data:blog.pageType == &quot;label&quot;'/>
    <div class='container'>
      <nav aria-label='مسار التنقل' class='breadcrumb'>
        <a expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'>الرئيسية</a>
        <span aria-hidden='true' class='breadcrumb-sep'><i class='fas fa-chevron-left'/></span>
        <span aria-current='page'><data:blog.pageName/></span>
      </nav>
      <div class='label-header'>
        <h1><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-tag'/> <data:blog.pageName/></h1>
        <p>جميع المقالات ضمن هذا التصنيف</p>
      </div>
      <section aria-label='المقالات' class='posts-grid stagger-children'>
        <b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'>
          <article class='post-card fin-clickable-card' expr:data-url='data:post.url'>
            <div class='card-image-wrapper'>
              <b:if cond='data:post.firstImageUrl'>
                <a expr:href='data:post.url'><img width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image lazy' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:data-src='data:post.firstImageUrl' expr:src='data:post.firstImageUrl' loading='lazy' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/></a>
              <b:elseif cond='data:post.thumbnailUrl'/>
                <a expr:href='data:post.url'><img width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image lazy' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:data-src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' expr:src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' loading='lazy' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/></a>
              <b:else/>
                <a expr:href='data:post.url'><img alt='' width='400' height='225' decoding='async' class='card-image' loading='lazy' src='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png'/></a>
              </b:if>
            </div>
            <div class='card-content'>
              <b:if cond='data:post.labels'>
                <div class='card-labels'>
                  <b:loop values='data:post.labels' var='label'>
                    <a class='card-label' expr:href='data:label.url'><data:label.name/></a>
                  </b:loop>
                </div>
              </b:if>
              <h2 class='card-title'><a expr:href='data:post.url'><data:post.title/></a></h2>
              <p class='card-snippet'><data:post.snippet/></p>
              <div class='card-footer'>
                <div class='card-date'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-calendar'/> <data:post.date/></div>
                <a class='read-link arabic-text' expr:href='data:post.url'>اقرأ المزيد <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-arrow-left'/></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </b:loop>
      </section>
      <b:if cond='data:newerPageUrl or data:olderPageUrl'>
        <nav aria-label='التنقل بين الصفحات' class='pagination'>
          <b:if cond='data:newerPageUrl'><a class='page-btn' expr:href='data:newerPageUrl'><i class='fas fa-chevron-right'/> السابق</a></b:if>
          <b:if cond='data:olderPageUrl'><a class='page-btn' expr:href='data:olderPageUrl'>التالي <i class='fas fa-chevron-left'/></a></b:if>
        </nav>
      </b:if>
    </div>

  <!-- &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; SINGLE POST &#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552;&#9552; -->
  <b:else/>
    <b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'>
      <div class='container-sm post-container'>
        <nav aria-label='مسار التنقل' class='breadcrumb'>
          <a expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'>الرئيسية</a>
          <b:if cond='data:post.labels'>
            <span aria-hidden='true' class='breadcrumb-sep'><i class='fas fa-chevron-left'/></span>
            <b:loop index='i' values='data:post.labels' var='label'>
              <b:if cond='data:i == 0'><a expr:href='data:label.url'><data:label.name/></a></b:if>
            </b:loop>
          </b:if>
          <span aria-hidden='true' class='breadcrumb-sep'><i class='fas fa-chevron-left'/></span>
          <span aria-current='page'><data:post.title/></span>
        </nav>
        <article class='post-article' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='https://schema.org/Article'>
          <h1 class='post-title arabic-text' itemprop='headline'><data:post.title/></h1>
          <div class='post-meta arabic-text'>
            <span><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-calendar-days'/> <data:post.date/></span>
            <b:if cond='data:post.author'><span itemprop='author'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-user'/> <data:post.author/></span></b:if>
          </div>
          <div class='post-share-bar arabic-text' id='post-share-bar'>
            <span class='post-share-label'>مشاركة:</span>
            <button aria-label='مشاركة المقال' class='share-btn' id='post-share-native' style='display:none' type='button'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-share-nodes'/> مشاركة</button>
            <button aria-label='نسخ الرابط' class='share-btn' id='post-share-copy' type='button'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-link'/> نسخ الرابط</button>
            <a aria-label='مشاركة على تويتر' class='share-btn share-btn--twitter' id='post-share-twitter' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fab fa-twitter'/> تويتر</a>
            <a aria-label='مشاركة على واتساب' class='share-btn share-btn--whatsapp' id='post-share-whatsapp' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fab fa-whatsapp'/> واتساب</a>
          </div>
          <b:if cond='data:post.firstImageUrl'>
            <div class='post-featured-image'>
              <!-- fetchpriority=high + decoding=async: يُحدّد الصورة كـ LCP ويُحسّن FCP -->
              <img decoding='async' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:src='data:post.firstImageUrl' fetchpriority='high' itemprop='image' loading='eager' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/>
            </div>
          <b:elseif cond='data:post.thumbnailUrl'/>
            <div class='post-featured-image'>
              <img decoding='async' expr:alt='data:post.title' expr:src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' fetchpriority='high' itemprop='image' loading='eager' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/>
            </div>
          <b:else/>
            <div class='post-featured-image'>
              <img alt='' itemprop='image' loading='eager' decoding='async' src='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png'/>
            </div>
          </b:if>
          <div class='post-body-wrap'>
            <div class='toc-container' id='toc-container' style='display:none'>
              <div class='toc-header'>
                <i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-list-ul'/> <span class='arabic-text'>المحتويات</span>
                <button aria-expanded='true' aria-label='تبديل جدول المحتويات' class='toc-toggle' id='toc-toggle'><i class='fas fa-chevron-up'/></button>
              </div>
              <nav aria-label='محتويات المقال' class='toc-nav' id='toc-nav'/>
            </div>
            <div class='post-body arabic-text' id='post-body' itemprop='articleBody'><data:post.body/></div>
            <b:if cond='data:post.labels'>
              <div aria-label='تصنيفات' class='post-tags'>
                <b:loop values='data:post.labels' var='label'>
                  <a class='card-label' expr:href='data:label.url'><i aria-hidden='true' class='fas fa-tag'/> <data:label.name/></a>
                </b:loop>
              </div>
            </b:if>
          </div>
        </article>
        <nav aria-label='التنقل بين المقالات' class='post-nav'>
          <b:if cond='data:newerPageUrl'><a class='page-btn' expr:href='data:newerPageUrl'><i class='fas fa-chevron-right'/> السابق</a></b:if>
          <a class='page-btn' expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'><i class='fas fa-home'/> الرئيسية</a>
          <b:if cond='data:olderPageUrl'><a class='page-btn' expr:href='data:olderPageUrl'>التالي <i class='fas fa-chevron-left'/></a></b:if>
        </nav>
        <b:if cond='data:post.allowComments'>
          <div class='comments-section'>
            <h3 class='arabic-text'>التعليقات</h3>
            <b:include data='post' name='comment_picker'/>
          </div>
        </b:if>
      </div>
    </b:loop>
  </b:if>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='backlinkDeleteIcon' var='backlink'/>
    <b:includable id='backlinks' var='post'/>
    <b:includable id='comment-form' var='post'>
  <div class='comment-form'><a name='comment-form'/>
    <b:if cond='data:mobile'>
      <h4 id='comment-post-message'><a expr:id='data:widget.instanceId + &quot;_comment-editor-toggle-link&quot;' href='javascript:void(0)'><data:postCommentMsg/></a></h4>
      <p><data:blogCommentMessage/></p><data:blogTeamBlogMessage/>
      <a expr:href='data:post.commentFormIframeSrc' id='comment-editor-src'/>
      <iframe allowtransparency='true' class='blogger-iframe-colorize blogger-comment-from-post' expr:height='data:cmtIframeInitialHeight' frameborder='0' id='comment-editor' name='comment-editor' src='' style='display:none' width='100%'/>
    <b:else/>
      <h4 id='comment-post-message'><data:postCommentMsg/></h4>
      <p><data:blogCommentMessage/></p><data:blogTeamBlogMessage/>
      <a expr:href='data:post.commentFormIframeSrc' id='comment-editor-src'/>
      <iframe allowtransparency='true' class='blogger-iframe-colorize blogger-comment-from-post' expr:height='data:cmtIframeInitialHeight' frameborder='0' id='comment-editor' name='comment-editor' src='' width='100%'/>
    </b:if>
    <data:post.cmtfpIframe/>
    <script type='text/javascript'>BLOG_CMT_createIframe(&#39;<data:post.appRpcRelayPath/>&#39;);</script>
  </div>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='commentDeleteIcon' var='comment'>
  <span expr:class='&quot;item-control &quot; + data:comment.adminClass'>
    <b:if cond='data:showCmtPopup'><div class='goog-toggle-button'><div class='goog-inline-block comment-action-icon'/></div>
    <b:else/><a class='comment-delete' expr:href='data:comment.deleteUrl' expr:title='data:top.deleteCommentMsg' style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--error);opacity:.65;transition:opacity .18s' onmouseenter='this.style.opacity=1' onmouseleave='this.style.opacity=.65'><svg aria-label='حذف' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 448 512' width='13' height='13' fill='currentColor'><path d='M135.2 17.7L128 32H32C14.3 32 0 46.3 0 64S14.3 96 32 96H416c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32H320l-7.2-14.3C307.4 6.8 296.3 0 284.2 0H163.8c-12.1 0-23.2 6.8-28.6 17.7zM416 128H32L53.2 467c1.6 25.3 22.6 45 47.9 45H346.9c25.3 0 46.3-19.7 47.9-45L416 128z'/></svg></a></b:if>
  </span>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='comment_count_picker' var='post'><a class='comment-link' expr:href='data:post.addCommentUrl' expr:onclick='data:post.addCommentOnclick'><data:post.commentLabelFull/>:</a></b:includable>
    <b:includable id='comment_picker' var='post'>
  <b:if cond='data:post.showThreadedComments'><b:include data='post' name='threaded_comments'/>
  <b:else/><b:include data='post' name='comments'/></b:if>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='comments' var='post'>
  <b:if cond='data:post.allowComments'>
    <div class='comments' id='comments'>
      <b:if cond='data:post.comments'>
        <div class='comments-content'>
          <b:loop values='data:post.comments' var='comment'>
            <div class='comment' expr:id='data:comment.anchorName'>
              <div class='avatar-image-container'>
                <b:if cond='data:comment.authorPhoto'>
                  <img expr:alt='data:comment.author' expr:src='data:comment.authorPhoto.url' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>
                <b:else/>
                  <svg aria-hidden='true' fill='none' viewBox='0 0 40 40' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect fill='var(--primary-soft,rgba(79,70,229,.12))' height='40' rx='20' width='40'/><circle cx='20' cy='15' fill='var(--primary-color,#4f46e5)' opacity='.7' r='6'/><ellipse cx='20' cy='34' fill='var(--primary-color,#4f46e5)' opacity='.5' rx='11' ry='7'/></svg>
                </b:if>
              </div>
              <div class='comment-block'>
                <div class='comment-header'>
                  <span class='user-name'><data:comment.author/></span>
                  <span class='datetime'><data:comment.timestamp/></span>
                  <b:include cond='data:comment.isAdmin' data='comment' name='commentDeleteIcon'/>
                </div>
                <div class='comment-content arabic-text'><data:comment.body/></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </b:loop>
        </div>
      </b:if>

      <b:if cond='data:post.allowNewComments'>
        <div class='comment-form'><a name='comment-form'/>
          <h4 class='arabic-text'>أضف تعليقا&#1611;</h4>
          <a expr:href='data:post.commentFormIframeSrc' id='comment-editor-src'/>
          <iframe allowtransparency='true' class='blogger-iframe-colorize blogger-comment-from-post' expr:height='data:cmtIframeInitialHeight' frameborder='0' id='comment-editor' name='comment-editor' src='' width='100%'/>
          <data:post.cmtfpIframe/>
          <script type='text/javascript'>BLOG_CMT_createIframe(&#39;<data:post.appRpcRelayPath/>&#39;);</script>
        </div>
      </b:if>
    </div>
  </b:if>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='feedLinks'>
  <b:if cond='data:blog.pageType != &quot;item&quot;'>
    <b:if cond='data:feedLinks'><div class='blog-feeds'><b:include data='feedLinks' name='feedLinksBody'/></div></b:if>
  <b:else/>
    <div class='post-feeds'><b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'><b:include cond='data:post.allowComments and data:post.feedLinks' data='post.feedLinks' name='feedLinksBody'/></b:loop></div>
  </b:if>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='feedLinksBody' var='links'>
  <div class='feed-links'><data:feedLinksMsg/>
    <b:loop values='data:links' var='f'><a class='feed-link' expr:href='data:f.url' expr:type='data:f.mimeType' rel='noopener' target='_blank'><data:f.name/> (<data:f.feedType/>)</a></b:loop>
  </div>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='iframe_comments' var='post'/>
    <b:includable id='mobile-index-post' var='post'>
  <div class='mobile-date-outer date-outer'>
    <b:if cond='data:post.dateHeader'><div class='date-header'><span><data:post.dateHeader/></span></div></b:if>
    <div class='mobile-post-outer'>
      <a expr:href='data:post.url'><h3 class='mobile-index-title entry-title' itemprop='name'><data:post.title/></h3><div class='mobile-index-arrow'>&amp;rsaquo;</div>
        <div class='mobile-index-contents'>
          <b:if cond='data:post.thumbnailUrl'><div class='mobile-index-thumbnail'><div class='Image'><img expr:src='data:post.thumbnailUrl' expr:alt='data:post.title' loading='lazy' decoding='async' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=&apos;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png&apos;'/></div></div><b:else/><div class='mobile-index-thumbnail'><div class='Image'><img src='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjk-3pYamtU_7mMeQIrNQ4pAWO_mpJwYwjA7pbMgEXv9c3jy3qkqWlE6Ac1LuEDzisjgpGvpJ7YNtg50-QDUcQMzmqC-fIqhotqMOaWderqBVILAhjsGfW-jV8k7nwZfF9PXzM7lSyGXLz_QbNjl9TX96CquHB5BuzO89_VBWQ2dCJDHhuxU5lWYXmHL5Zg/s1600/a-minimalist-flat-vector-illustration-in-google-ma-1780859865696.png'/></div></div></b:if>
          <div class='post-body'><b:if cond='data:post.snippet'><data:post.snippet/></b:if></div>
        </div><div style='clear:both'/>
      </a>
      <div class='mobile-index-comment'><b:include cond='data:blog.pageType != &quot;static_page&quot; and data:post.allowComments and data:post.numComments != 0' data='post' name='comment_count_picker'/></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='mobile-main' var='top'>
  <div class='blog-posts hfeed'><b:include data='top' name='status-message'/>
    <b:if cond='data:blog.pageType == &quot;index&quot;'><b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'><b:include data='post' name='mobile-index-post'/></b:loop>
    <b:else/><b:loop values='data:posts' var='post'><b:include data='post' name='mobile-post'/></b:loop></b:if>
  </div><b:include name='mobile-nextprev'/>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='mobile-nextprev'>
  <div class='blog-pager' id='blog-pager'>
    <b:if cond='data:newerPageUrl'><div class='mobile-link-button' id='blog-pager-newer-link'><a class='blog-pager-newer-link' expr:href='data:newerPageUrl' expr:id='data:widget.instanceId + &quot;_blog-pager-newer-link&quot;' expr:title='data:newerPageTitle'>&amp;lsaquo;</a></div></b:if>
    <b:if cond='data:olderPageUrl'><div class='mobile-link-button' id='blog-pager-older-link'><a class='blog-pager-older-link' expr:href='data:olderPageUrl' expr:id='data:widget.instanceId + &quot;_blog-pager-older-link&quot;' expr:title='data:olderPageTitle'>&amp;rsaquo;</a></div></b:if>
    <div class='mobile-link-button' id='blog-pager-home-link'><a class='home-link' expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'><data:homeMsg/></a></div>
    <div class='mobile-desktop-link'><a class='home-link' expr:href='data:desktopLinkUrl'><data:desktopLinkMsg/></a></div>
  </div><div class='clear'/>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='mobile-post' var='post'>
  <div class='date-outer'>
    <b:if cond='data:post.dateHeader'><h2 class='date-header'><span><data:post.dateHeader/></span></h2></b:if>
    <div class='date-posts'><div class='post-outer'>
      <div class='post hentry uncustomized-post-template' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='http://schema.org/BlogPosting'>
        <b:if cond='data:post.thumbnailUrl'><meta expr:content='data:post.thumbnailUrl' itemprop='image_url'/></b:if>
        <meta expr:content='data:blog.blogId' itemprop='blogId'/><meta expr:content='data:post.id' itemprop='postId'/><a expr:name='data:post.id'/>
        <b:if cond='data:post.title'><h3 class='post-title entry-title' itemprop='name'><b:if cond='data:post.link'><a expr:href='data:post.link'><data:post.title/></a><b:elseif cond='data:post.url and data:blog.url != data:post.url'/><a expr:href='data:post.url'><data:post.title/></a><b:else/><data:post.title/></b:if></h3></b:if>
        <div class='post-header'><div class='post-header-line-1'/></div>
        <div class='post-body entry-content' expr:id='&quot;post-body-&quot; + data:post.id' itemprop='articleBody'><data:post.body/><div style='clear:both'/></div>
        <div class='post-footer'><div class='post-footer-line post-footer-line-1'><span class='post-author vcard'><b:if cond='data:top.showAuthor'><b:if cond='data:post.authorProfileUrl'><span class='fn' itemprop='author' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='http://schema.org/Person'><meta expr:content='data:post.authorProfileUrl' itemprop='url'/><a expr:href='data:post.authorProfileUrl' rel='author' title='author profile'><span itemprop='name'><data:post.author/></span></a></span><b:else/><span class='fn' itemprop='author' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='http://schema.org/Person'><span itemprop='name'><data:post.author/></span></span></b:if></b:if></span></div></div>
      </div>
      <b:include cond='data:blog.pageType in {&quot;static_page&quot;,&quot;item&quot;}' data='post' name='comment_picker'/>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='nextprev'>
  <div class='blog-pager' id='blog-pager'>
    <b:if cond='data:newerPageUrl'><span id='blog-pager-newer-link'><a class='blog-pager-newer-link' expr:href='data:newerPageUrl' expr:id='data:widget.instanceId + &quot;_blog-pager-newer-link&quot;' expr:title='data:newerPageTitle'><data:newerPageTitle/></a></span></b:if>
    <b:if cond='data:olderPageUrl'><span id='blog-pager-older-link'><a class='blog-pager-older-link' expr:href='data:olderPageUrl' expr:id='data:widget.instanceId + &quot;_blog-pager-older-link&quot;' expr:title='data:olderPageTitle'><data:olderPageTitle/></a></span></b:if>
    <a class='home-link' expr:href='data:blog.homepageUrl'><data:homeMsg/></a>
  </div><div class='clear'/>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='post' var='post'>
  <div class='post hentry uncustomized-post-template' itemprop='blogPost' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='http://schema.org/BlogPosting'>
    <b:if cond='data:post.firstImageUrl'><meta expr:content='data:post.firstImageUrl' itemprop='image_url'/></b:if>
    <meta expr:content='data:blog.blogId' itemprop='blogId'/><meta expr:content='data:post.id' itemprop='postId'/><a expr:name='data:post.id'/>
    <b:if cond='data:post.title'><h3 class='post-title entry-title' itemprop='name'><b:if cond='data:post.link or (data:post.url and data:blog.url != data:post.url)'><a expr:href='data:post.link ? data:post.link : data:post.url'><data:post.title/></a><b:else/><data:post.title/></b:if></h3></b:if>
    <div class='post-header'><div class='post-header-line-1'/></div>
    <div class='post-body entry-content' expr:id='&quot;post-body-&quot; + data:post.id' expr:itemprop='(data:blog.metaDescription ? &quot;&quot; : &quot;description &quot;) + &quot;articleBody&quot;'><data:post.body/><div style='clear:both'/></div>
    <b:if cond='data:post.hasJumpLink'><div class='jump-link'><a expr:href='data:post.url + &quot;#more&quot;' expr:title='data:post.title'><data:post.jumpText/></a></div></b:if>
    <div class='post-footer'><div class='post-footer-line post-footer-line-1'><span class='post-icons'><b:include data='post' name='postQuickEdit'/></span></div></div>
  </div>
</b:includable>
    <b:includable id='postQuickEdit' var='post'>
  <b:if cond='data:post.editUrl'><span expr:class='&quot;item-control &quot; + data:post.adminClass'><a expr:href='data:post.editUrl' expr:title='data:top.editPostMsg' style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--primary-color);opacity:.65;transition:opacity .18s' onmouseenter='this.style.opacity=1' onmouseleave='this.style.opacity=.65'><svg aria-label='تعديل المقال' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 512 512' width='16' height='16' fill='currentColor'><path d='M362.7 19.3L314.3 67.7 444.3 197.7l48.4-48.4c25-25 25-65.5 0-90.5L453.3 19.3c-25-25-65.5-25-90.5 0zm-71 71L58.6 323.5c-10.4 10.4-18 23.3-22.2 37.4L1 481.2C-1.5 489.7 .8 498.8 7 505s15.3 8.5 23.7 6.1l120.3-35.4c14.1-4.2 27-11.8 37.4-22.2L421.7 230.3 291.7 100.3z'/></svg></a></span></b:if>
</b:includable>
